WEBVTT

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:07.470
I can't finish reading the magazine pages

00:00:09.390 --> 00:00:14.380
I get the feeling that I must read it

00:00:16.270 --> 00:00:21.130
Game cartridges are stacked in the corner of the room

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:27.830
Is there no meaning if I don't play them?

00:00:30.060 --> 00:00:32.930
You're on the other side of the table

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:36.300
I'm talking to you, but...

00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:43.230
You don't change your facial expression at all

00:00:44.170 --> 00:00:49.480
Even though I'm this close to you

00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:56.750
These feelings don't reach you, don't reach you

00:00:57.170 --> 00:01:03.490
What is truly precious?

00:01:07.860 --> 00:01:14.850
My cards, let's face the strongest duelist in the Kingdom together!

00:01:23.360 --> 00:01:24.840
Arrow Shot!

00:01:31.420 --> 00:01:37.260
Yugi boy is like a tiny animal pathetically squirming in the palm of my hand.

00:01:37.260 --> 00:01:41.750
I know your hand as if it was my own.

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:43.460
Mind Scan!

00:01:47.440 --> 00:01:50.220
He looks at me as if he can see my cards.

00:01:50.480 --> 00:01:53.580
What I'm feeling is not my imagination!

00:01:53.890 --> 00:01:56.490
You drew Summoned Skull.

00:01:56.490 --> 00:02:01.830
He's reading my mind, but I can't do anything about it.

00:02:01.830 --> 00:02:07.840
Impossible to Defeat!?
The Invincible Toon Army

00:02:20.020 --> 00:02:23.260
Yugi, don't get caught in Pegasus's pace!

00:02:23.260 --> 00:02:25.140
Be careful, Yugi!

00:02:28.790 --> 00:02:29.900
What?

00:02:29.900 --> 00:02:34.820
Mokuba has the keys to the storage facility containing the documents needed for the contract.

00:02:34.820 --> 00:02:37.140
Bring him back at all costs.

00:02:37.140 --> 00:02:42.600
If he escapes, I don't know what to say to Pegasus.

00:02:45.380 --> 00:02:47.260
Bakura, where are you going?

00:02:48.400 --> 00:02:51.050
I'm going to look for Honda.

00:02:51.420 --> 00:02:53.550
Thanks, Bakura.

00:02:53.550 --> 00:02:58.120
That punk Honda!  What's he doing at an important time like this?

00:03:06.140 --> 00:03:10.200
Yugi boy, I've read what your strategy will be during your turn.

00:03:10.600 --> 00:03:18.380
You will set the trap card Spellbinding Circle and play Summoned Skull in defense position.

00:03:18.380 --> 00:03:22.310
It's your attempt to get my monsters to attack.

00:03:22.310 --> 00:03:23.880
My turn.

00:03:23.880 --> 00:03:26.220
I set one card.

00:03:26.660 --> 00:03:30.390
Then I play Summoned Skull in defense position!

00:03:34.340 --> 00:03:35.860
I end my turn.

00:03:35.860 --> 00:03:38.030
Okay.  It's my turn.

00:03:38.460 --> 00:03:47.480
Fine.  I'll step into your trap, but we'll see who really falls into a trap in the end.

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:54.510
I switch Ryu-Ran to attack position.

00:03:57.450 --> 00:04:00.180
Attack Summoned Skull.

00:04:02.550 --> 00:04:03.720
My trap activates!

00:04:04.120 --> 00:04:06.200
Spellbinding Circle!

00:04:10.590 --> 00:04:14.400
The monster that attacks this card falls into a trap.

00:04:19.240 --> 00:04:20.670
Oh no!

00:04:21.040 --> 00:04:24.610
Ryu-Ran loses 700 attack points!

00:04:24.610 --> 00:04:25.700
All right!

00:04:25.700 --> 00:04:28.050
He caught Pegasus's monster!

00:04:51.220 --> 00:04:52.540
It's my turn!

00:04:52.940 --> 00:04:55.300
I switch Summoned Skull to attack position!

00:04:59.120 --> 00:05:01.260
Attack Ryu-Ran!

00:05:02.080 --> 00:05:03.640
Magic Lightning!

00:05:05.860 --> 00:05:09.720
I activate the trap card Trap Displacement.

00:05:09.720 --> 00:05:11.470
What?  Trap Displacement?

00:05:11.470 --> 00:05:12.720
Yes.

00:05:13.840 --> 00:05:22.080
This card lets me move your trap's effect from my monster to yours.

00:05:32.220 --> 00:05:37.360
Summoned Skull is caught in Spellbinding Circle, dropping its attack points.

00:05:37.360 --> 00:05:41.530
None of your strategies will work against me.

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:44.250
Dragon Flame!

00:05:54.020 --> 00:05:56.860
He's anticipating all my strategies.

00:05:57.730 --> 00:05:59.460
How can I fight back?

00:06:00.660 --> 00:06:02.380
This isn't fair, Pegasus!

00:06:02.380 --> 00:06:03.770
No matter how Yugi battles...

00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:05.420
Don't say that!

00:06:05.420 --> 00:06:08.080
We can't be the ones to give up hope!

00:06:08.080 --> 00:06:11.080
I'm sorry.  You're right.

00:06:11.300 --> 00:06:14.520
No matter what the situation, Yugi never gives up.

00:06:16.420 --> 00:06:19.200
Yugi, don't lose.

00:06:21.400 --> 00:06:23.300
There he is!  Over there!

00:06:31.480 --> 00:06:32.940
That's far enough.

00:06:35.040 --> 00:06:37.200
You're going back to prison.

00:06:37.820 --> 00:06:39.430
Damn!

00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:47.350
What's that sound?

00:06:53.220 --> 00:06:55.540
Bakura, what are you doing here?

00:06:55.540 --> 00:06:56.660
Who are you?

00:06:57.450 --> 00:07:00.640
You better behave or you'll regret it!

00:07:00.640 --> 00:07:02.270
Bakura, don't worry about me.

00:07:02.650 --> 00:07:04.500
Get out of here!

00:07:07.440 --> 00:07:08.920
How interesting.

00:07:08.920 --> 00:07:11.220
What will you do if I don't behave?

00:07:11.220 --> 00:07:12.300
How dare you!

00:07:12.820 --> 00:07:14.640
This will be my weapon.

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:16.410
Chain Energy!

00:07:16.410 --> 00:07:17.550
Stop playing around!

00:07:22.060 --> 00:07:23.720
What is this?

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:25.920
I can't move!

00:07:26.340 --> 00:07:28.090
Bakura, what did you do?

00:07:28.700 --> 00:07:30.860
This is our chance to escape.

00:07:31.400 --> 00:07:33.260
Y-Yeah.

00:07:33.260 --> 00:07:34.620
Hey!  Stop!

00:07:34.620 --> 00:07:35.540
You guys!

00:07:37.160 --> 00:07:39.200
Damn!  Stop!

00:07:39.200 --> 00:07:40.950
What is this?

00:07:42.100 --> 00:07:44.370
This is A Squad requesting backup!

00:07:44.660 --> 00:07:46.540
My turn.

00:07:47.720 --> 00:07:55.080
There must be a way to overcome the power of Pegasus's Millennium Eye and his Mind Scan.

00:07:55.080 --> 00:07:56.220
No!

00:07:56.420 --> 00:07:59.860
There's no way to overcome it, Yugi boy.

00:08:00.300 --> 00:08:02.790
He even knows my inner thoughts.

00:08:05.230 --> 00:08:08.800
A game is a battle between our psyches.

00:08:08.800 --> 00:08:13.640
Whoever conquers the opponent's soul is the winner.

00:08:13.640 --> 00:08:20.040
You do not have the power to take a single step into my soul.

00:08:20.040 --> 00:08:24.600
Nor into the game world that I've created.

00:08:25.050 --> 00:08:28.050
I'll now prove that to you.

00:08:28.620 --> 00:08:30.890
My card is...

00:08:33.100 --> 00:08:34.760
Toon World!

00:08:48.700 --> 00:08:49.910
Toon World?

00:08:51.100 --> 00:08:53.340
This is bad!  It's that card again!

00:08:59.240 --> 00:09:05.020
Toon World is a world of games and my greatest creation.

00:09:05.020 --> 00:09:08.460
Toon characters are the greatest!

00:09:11.460 --> 00:09:18.430
Yes, all monsters on my field have turned into invincible Toon Monsters.

00:09:20.180 --> 00:09:25.980
And non-Toon Monsters can't destroy Toon Monsters.

00:09:25.980 --> 00:09:28.610
I'm sorry, Yugi boy.

00:09:29.120 --> 00:09:34.100
Manga Ryu-Ran, attack that set monster in defense position!

00:09:42.540 --> 00:09:45.120
Giant Soldier of Stone is destroyed.

00:09:50.100 --> 00:09:56.960
After a Toon Monster attacks, it hides inside Toon World.

00:09:57.680 --> 00:10:01.400
It's a world that your monsters cannot enter.

00:10:02.960 --> 00:10:07.750
As long as they hide inside Toon World, I can't attack them.

00:10:07.750 --> 00:10:09.850
This is how he defeated Kaiba.

00:10:10.080 --> 00:10:16.540
I switch Toon Mermaid to attack position and end my turn.

00:10:18.700 --> 00:10:24.520
Even if I play a monster from my hand in defense position, it will only be destroyed.

00:10:26.580 --> 00:10:33.680
Therefore, I'll check if a Normal Monster can attack a Toon Monster.

00:10:33.900 --> 00:10:35.450
Celtic Guardian!

00:10:36.680 --> 00:10:38.350
In attack position!

00:10:38.960 --> 00:10:43.200
Celtic Guardian and Toon Mermaid have the same number of attack points.

00:10:43.200 --> 00:10:46.550
If it can attack her, they will both be destroyed.

00:10:46.550 --> 00:10:50.990
All right, Celtic Guardian attacks Toon Mermaid!

00:10:53.600 --> 00:10:54.960
Spirit Sword Slash!

00:10:56.900 --> 00:10:57.770
What?

00:11:19.200 --> 00:11:20.740
What's going on?

00:11:20.740 --> 00:11:23.420
It grabbed Celtic Guardian's sword!

00:11:23.420 --> 00:11:26.200
It's pointless, Yugi boy.

00:11:26.200 --> 00:11:31.870
Due to its special abilities, a normal attack doesn't work against a Toon Monster.

00:11:38.260 --> 00:11:40.370
Toon Mermaid Arrow!

00:11:44.050 --> 00:11:45.660
Celtic Guardian!

00:11:45.660 --> 00:11:48.220
Damn!  That's not fair, Pegasus!

00:11:48.650 --> 00:11:52.650
Like I thought, it's impossible to attack Toon Monsters.

00:11:52.650 --> 00:11:54.300
Exactly.

00:11:54.540 --> 00:11:57.120
Only a Toon can defeat a Toon.

00:11:57.120 --> 00:12:00.090
Toons are the perfect life form.

00:12:05.980 --> 00:12:10.040
The power of his Millennium Eye lets him know my strategies.

00:12:10.040 --> 00:12:12.440
And he's also stopped me from attacking.

00:12:13.000 --> 00:12:16.660
Is there any way I can win this duel?

00:12:19.660 --> 00:12:21.960
It's my turn.

00:12:23.080 --> 00:12:28.620
I set these two cards and end my turn.

00:12:32.040 --> 00:12:34.820
Are they spell cards or traps?

00:12:35.060 --> 00:12:36.230
It's my turn!

00:12:36.780 --> 00:12:41.170
Even if I play a monster in attack position, I can't destroy a Toon.

00:12:41.640 --> 00:12:44.170
And he also has traps.

00:12:45.180 --> 00:12:47.110
I set a monster in defense position!

00:12:50.120 --> 00:12:52.520
Just as I expected.

00:12:52.520 --> 00:12:56.480
I will now flip over one of my set cards.

00:12:58.620 --> 00:13:02.320
I activate the trap card Gorgon's Eye.

00:13:11.700 --> 00:13:14.370
What?  Horn Imp was turned into stone!

00:13:14.370 --> 00:13:21.600
This Continuous Trap turns all your monsters in defense position into stone.

00:13:21.810 --> 00:13:29.750
And when a monster turned into stone is destroyed, you lose life points equal to half its defense points.

00:13:29.750 --> 00:13:37.860
That means you're forced to attack my Toons every turn, even if those attacks are meaningless.

00:13:41.500 --> 00:13:43.480
It's my turn.

00:13:43.480 --> 00:13:47.930
Let me introduce you to my lovely and funky friend.

00:13:48.780 --> 00:13:51.470
The spell card Mimicat!

00:13:51.680 --> 00:13:58.410
This copy card can transform into any card in your graveyard.

00:13:58.800 --> 00:14:00.350
A copy card?

00:14:14.900 --> 00:14:17.780
You're a mischievous cat like always.

00:14:17.780 --> 00:14:21.100
Which card do you want to transform into?

00:14:23.600 --> 00:14:24.720
Nice.

00:14:24.720 --> 00:14:26.870
That's a good idea.

00:14:27.560 --> 00:14:34.810
Yugi boy, it wants to transform into Summoned Skull that's in your graveyard.

00:14:35.020 --> 00:14:37.480
What?  My Summoned Skull?

00:14:37.650 --> 00:14:41.940
Yes, and Toon World is on the field.

00:14:41.940 --> 00:14:44.660
You know what this means, don't you?

00:14:45.590 --> 00:14:47.860
Now go!

00:14:53.640 --> 00:15:00.340
Your Summoned Skull that's now a resident of Toon World will appear shortly.

00:15:14.680 --> 00:15:18.800
Toon World has opened to the page with the devil's castle.

00:15:18.800 --> 00:15:22.900
Come out, my Toon Summoned Skull!

00:15:28.740 --> 00:15:30.470
Toon Summoned Skull?

00:15:35.700 --> 00:15:41.350
Yugi boy, doesn't it look more lovely than before?

00:15:44.760 --> 00:15:47.220
Pegasus, how dare you!

00:15:47.220 --> 00:15:49.500
Oh, I'm so scared.

00:15:50.420 --> 00:15:52.820
Toon Summoned Skull attacks!

00:16:00.820 --> 00:16:03.100
The fossilized Horn Imp is destroyed.

00:16:03.100 --> 00:16:10.540
Due to Gorgon's Eye's effect, you lose 500 life points, which is equal to half of Horn Imp's defense points.

00:16:21.220 --> 00:16:23.760
I end my turn.

00:16:23.760 --> 00:16:29.530
Yugi boy, how does it feel to be attacked by your own monster?

00:16:29.760 --> 00:16:32.320
It hid inside his book again.

00:16:32.320 --> 00:16:35.970
Damn!  Isn't there any way to defeat those Toons?

00:16:36.240 --> 00:16:40.700
My own monster transformed into a Toon and attacked me.

00:16:40.700 --> 00:16:42.600
It's your turn.

00:16:59.220 --> 00:17:02.260
You drew Dark Magician.

00:17:07.380 --> 00:17:13.070
Pegasus really does know my hand and strategies.

00:17:31.340 --> 00:17:33.890
Bakura, what did you do back there?

00:17:34.130 --> 00:17:36.860
That's not important.  We need to flee.

00:17:37.280 --> 00:17:39.330
You better explain later.

00:17:40.900 --> 00:17:42.950
It's no good.  It won't open.

00:17:43.700 --> 00:17:44.760
Let's go.

00:17:53.200 --> 00:17:54.940
We can get out there!

00:17:56.350 --> 00:17:57.120
What?

00:18:11.640 --> 00:18:13.900
You saved me.

00:18:15.160 --> 00:18:19.960
As long as Toon World is on his field, my normal attacks won't work.

00:18:20.960 --> 00:18:23.280
And I also can't defend.

00:18:24.200 --> 00:18:27.900
In this situation, is there any way I can win?

00:18:27.900 --> 00:18:28.820
No!

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:33.250
There is no way you can defeat me.

00:18:33.620 --> 00:18:38.520
I know that you're losing your will to fight.

00:18:38.520 --> 00:18:42.690
Well?  Will you surrender this duel, Yugi boy?

00:18:44.120 --> 00:18:46.380
Yugi, don't give up!

00:18:46.380 --> 00:18:50.670
If you admit defeat, you'll end up losing your soul like Mokuba and Kaiba!

00:18:50.880 --> 00:18:55.340
And you won't be able to save Grandpa, Mokuba, and Kaiba!

00:18:55.340 --> 00:18:57.720
Please try your best, Yugi!

00:18:57.720 --> 00:18:58.510
Yugi!

00:18:58.720 --> 00:19:03.860
But my odds of winning are close to zero.

00:19:05.280 --> 00:19:06.340
Grandpa...

00:19:10.520 --> 00:19:12.460
Mokuba...  Kaiba...

00:19:13.120 --> 00:19:14.400
I...

00:19:19.880 --> 00:19:22.000
We'll have to go back.

00:19:22.000 --> 00:19:23.940
They're over there!

00:19:23.940 --> 00:19:25.600
Don't let them get away this time!

00:19:26.040 --> 00:19:28.340
Damn!  We're trapped!

00:19:28.340 --> 00:19:31.820
It's not like you to give up, Honda.

00:19:32.040 --> 00:19:34.550
Do you have any bright ideas?

00:19:35.080 --> 00:19:38.480
I'll just do whatever it takes.

00:19:48.130 --> 00:19:49.560
Yugi!

00:19:52.000 --> 00:19:57.680
If I give up, their three souls will never return.

00:19:58.000 --> 00:20:03.160
No matter how bad my odds are for winning, I can't afford to give up.

00:20:07.400 --> 00:20:10.120
Pegasus, I won't give up.

00:20:10.380 --> 00:20:13.820
I'm betting on my potential until the very end!

00:20:15.040 --> 00:20:16.820
That's pointless, Yugi boy.

00:20:16.820 --> 00:20:20.990
No matter how hard you try, it's over for you.

00:20:32.200 --> 00:20:34.420
The Millennium Eye can see Yugi's hand.

00:20:34.420 --> 00:20:38.840
And Yugi can't attack or defend due to Toon World and Gorgon's Eye.

00:20:38.840 --> 00:20:45.320
He plays his Dark Magician-Magical Hats combo in desperation, but won't Pegasus solve this too?

00:20:45.320 --> 00:20:47.680
What?  Mind Scan isn't working?

00:20:47.680 --> 00:20:52.520
I see!  You switched places with the other Yugi before he read your mind!

00:20:52.520 --> 00:20:56.200
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Begin Counterattack!
Mind Shuffle

00:20:56.200 --> 00:20:57.920
Duel, standby!

00:21:01.720 --> 00:21:10.120
The flask glistens

00:21:11.160 --> 00:21:17.970
Wait for me in the science classroom

00:21:18.460 --> 00:21:26.940
If we put our cold hands together

00:21:27.640 --> 00:21:34.720
And rub them together, they become warm

00:21:36.420 --> 00:21:40.550
Shower of happiness

00:21:40.840 --> 00:21:44.660
I will shower you with it

00:21:44.990 --> 00:21:52.930
I will support you even when you feel lonely

00:21:53.130 --> 00:21:57.170
Shower of happiness

00:21:57.440 --> 00:22:01.300
You are not alone

00:22:01.680 --> 00:22:08.020
You're protected by a giant ring of friendship
